From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Stingler <roman.stingler@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:20:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: glymur-a16: add DisplayPort audio DAI links

The Zenbook A16 (UX3607OA) drives its HDMI port through the Parade PS185HDM
bridge fed by mdss_dp2 (usb_2_qmpphy), and its two USB-C ports carry DP alt
mode on mdss_dp0 and mdss_dp1. Video works, but the sound node only wires the
WSA speaker and VA DMIC backends, so no DisplayPort/HDMI PCM is exposed and
PipeWire has no HDMI sink.

The x1e80100 machine driver already supports DisplayPort audio: it creates a
jack per DISPLAY_PORT_RX_x backend (x1e80100.c) and q6apm-lpass-dais.c
implements the HDMI hw_params. Add the three DAI links the external DP
controllers need, matching the pattern used by the hamoa and x1-crd boards.

This requires a topology that carries the DISPLAY_PORT_RX backends; the
current A16 topology is the CRD copy and has only WSA_CODEC_DMA_RX_0 and
VA_CODEC_DMA_TX_0.

Signed-off-by: Roman Stingler <roman.stingler@gmail.com>
---
 .../dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts  | 49 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 49 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts	2026-11-25 22:21:45.369038151 +0100
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts	2026-11-25 22:21:45.375268387 +0100
@@ -420,6 +420,55 @@
 				sound-dai = <&q6apm>;
 			};
 		};
+
+
+		dp0-dai-link {
+			link-name = "DP0 Playback";
+
+			codec {
+				sound-dai = <&mdss_dp0>;
+			};
+
+			cpu {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apmbedai DISPLAY_PORT_RX_0>;
+			};
+
+			platform {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apm>;
+			};
+		};
+
+		dp1-dai-link {
+			link-name = "DP1 Playback";
+
+			codec {
+				sound-dai = <&mdss_dp1>;
+			};
+
+			cpu {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apmbedai DISPLAY_PORT_RX_1>;
+			};
+
+			platform {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apm>;
+			};
+		};
+
+		dp2-dai-link {
+			link-name = "DP2 Playback";
+
+			codec {
+				sound-dai = <&mdss_dp2>;
+			};
+
+			cpu {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apmbedai DISPLAY_PORT_RX_2>;
+			};
+
+			platform {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apm>;
+			};
+		};
 	};
 
 };
